<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Breaking Changes (from Portamical 2.0.0 base)
- ❌ `IDisposable` interface implementation
- ❌ `Dispose()` and `Dispose(bool)` methods
- ❌ `ResetLogCounter()` method ? use `Resolver.ResetLogCounter()`
- ❌ `ArgsCode` property with setter

What's New
- Base Renamed: `PortamicalDataAttributeBase` → `PortamicalBaseDataAttribute` 
- Convert() Refactored: NEW parameterless overload (default `ArgsCode.Instance`)
- Pragma IDE0060** | Unused `testMethodName` (signature compatibility) |
- Pragma CA1825: Zero-length array false positive (compiler optimized)
- Documentation:+640 lines with pragma justifications &amp; 18+ examples
- TestBase Variants: 2 options: `TestBase` (Builder) or `TheoryData.TestBase` (Modern) |
- xunit.runner.json: moved from base Portamical module
</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageTags>test; unittest; testdata; portable; dynamicdata; datadriven; xunit;</PackageTags>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <Description>xUnit v2 adapter for Portamical: Universal, identity-driven test data modeling for .NET.</Description>
    <Copyright>(c) 2026. Csaba Dudas (CsabaDu)</Copyright>
    <Title>Portamical.xUnit (v2)</Title>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <Version>2.0.0</Version>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\icon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\LICENSE.txt">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Portamical" Version="2.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="xunit.assert" Version="2.9.3" />
    <PackageReference Include="xunit.core" Version="2.9.3" />
    <PackageReference Include="xunit.runner.visualstudio" Version="3.1.5">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Using Include="Xunit" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
